<div id="welcome" class="t-welcome t-section t-text-center">
  <div class="t-container mx-auto">
    <h2 class="t-h2">{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'es' %}Casa de Copas es una organización sin fines de lucro que financia discos que de otro modo no se harían, y pone estudios, ingenieros, productores y músicos al alcance de los artistas que los necesitan.{% else %}Casa de Copas is a nonprofit that funds records that would not otherwise get made, and puts
      studios, engineers, producers and players within reach of the artists who need them.{% endif %}</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="t-welcome-floated">
    <img width="233px" src="{{ 'parsifal.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="t-parsifal" />
    <img width="123px" src="{{ 'deer.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="t-deer" />
    <img width="125px" src="{{ 'sun.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="t-sun" />
    <img width="125px" src="{{ 'human.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="t-human" />
  </div>
</div>

<div id="service" class="t-service t-section t-text-center">
  <div class="t-container mx-auto">
    <h1 class="t-display-xl">{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'es' %}La herida sana en el servicio{% else %}The wound heals in service{% endif %}</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="t-welcome-floated">
    <img width="188px" src="{{ 'heart.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="t-heart" />
    <img width="196px" src="{{ 'cup.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="t-cup-phrase" />
    <img width="242px" src="{{ 'gold-frame.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="t-gold" />
    <img width="151px" src="{{ '3d.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="t-geometric" />
  </div>
</div>

<div id="about" class="t-about t-section">
  <div class="t-container mx-auto">
    <div class="t-w-3/4">
      <p>{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'es' %}Casa de Copas es una invitación a unirse a un movimiento. <br />No un lugar para visitar: algo a lo que pertenecer. <br />Los artistas financian el trabajo de los artistas que vienen detrás de ellos, y lo que gana la red vuelve al siguiente disco. <br />{% else %}Casa de Copas is an invitation to join a movement. <br />
        Not somewhere to visit — something to belong to. <br />
        Artists fund the work of the artists coming up behind them, and what the network earns goes back into the
        next record. <br />{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="t-mt-10">
      <a class="t-text-3xl" href="https://www.instagram.com/casadecopasmx/">{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'es' %}Síguenos en Instagram{% else %}Follow us on Instagram{% endif %} -></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="footer" class="t-footer t-section t-text-center t-text-orange">
  <div class="t-container mx-auto t-text-center">
    <h1 class="t-display-xl">{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'es' %}UN BIEN COMÚN PARA LA CREACIÓN{% else %}A COMMONS FOR CREATION{% endif %}</h1>
    <img src="{{ 'footer-sun.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="t-my-5" />
    <p>CASA DE COPAS EST. 2025</p>
    <div class="t-mt-5">{% render 'candid-seal', size: 80 %}</div>
    <div class="t-mt-10">
      <a class="t-text-3xl" href="https://www.instagram.com/casadecopasmx/">{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'es' %}Síguenos en Instagram{% else %}Follow us on Instagram{% endif %} -></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
  {
    "name": "Home Footer",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "section"
  }
{% endschema %}
